{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-26", "prepared_on": "2026-11-26", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-26</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Jensen Huang Apologizes to Nvidia Employees in First All-Hands Since His Return<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳回任後首場全員大會向 Nvidia 員工道歉</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Nvidia CEO opened up about his personal life, defended his reinstatement, and acknowledged that his intense management style had hurt his staff.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這位 Nvidia 執行長談到個人生活、為自己復職辯護，並承認強勢的管理風格曾傷害員工。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/jensen-huang-apologizes-to-nvidia-employees-in-first-all-hands-since-his-return/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI says heavy ChatGPT users may hit limits sooner as it merges Chat and Work<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 表示合併 Chat 與 Work 後，重度 ChatGPT 用戶可能更快碰到用量上限</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI will introduce a single usage meter across ChatGPT as it combines the Chat and Work experiences.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 在合併 Chat 與 Work 體驗的同時，ChatGPT 將改用單一的用量計量方式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/openai-says-heavy-chatgpt-users-may-hit-limits-sooner-as-it-merges-chat-and-work/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> FCC signs off on SpaceX's plan to put up to 1 million data center satellites into space<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">FCC 批准 SpaceX 部署最多 100 萬顆資料中心衛星</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The FCC authorized SpaceX to deploy up to 1 million AI chip-equipped satellites under its \"Starmind\" initiative. Google and Blue Origin are also pursuing space-based AI data centers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">FCC 核准 SpaceX 在「Starmind」計畫下部署多達 100 萬顆搭載 AI 晶片的衛星，Google 與 Blue Origin 也在研究太空 AI 資料中心。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/science/1042278/spacex-fcc-starmind-ai-space-data-centers\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Want to buy your kid an AI toy this Christmas? Not in New York<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">想在聖誕節買 AI 玩具給孩子？紐約州不行</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">New York has banned AI chatbot toys for five years, as new Common Sense Media research reveals safety failures including inappropriate content and risks to emotional development.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">紐約州禁售 AI 聊天機器人玩具五年；Common Sense Media 的新研究指出這類玩具有安全缺失，包括不當內容與對情緒發展的風險。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/want-to-buy-your-kid-an-ai-toy-this-christmas-not-in-new-york/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Claude can now turn artifacts into standalone Mac and Windows apps<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude 新功能可將物件變成獨立的 Mac、Windows App</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic is rolling out a beta feature in the Claude desktop apps that converts Claude-generated artifacts into desktop apps with their own icon and window, shareable with others.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 開始以 beta 版在 Mac 與 Windows 版 Claude App 提供此功能，可將 Claude 生成的物件轉成有圖示與視窗的桌機應用程式，並能分享給他人。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180804\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> UK warns AI-driven cyberattacks are exposing years of weak security<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">英國示警：AI 驅動的網路攻擊正暴露多年來的薄弱防護</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The UK's NCSC says AI hacking tools mostly rely on exploiting simple security flaws, and that \"building strong foundations has never mattered more.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">英國國家網路安全中心指出，AI 駭客工具多半靠利用簡單的安全缺陷得逞，並強調「打好基礎從未如此重要」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/24/uk-warns-ai-driven-cyberattacks-are-exposing-years-of-weak-security/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Anthropic Created a Honeypot to Lure AI Agents Into Misbehaving<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 打造蜜罐，引誘 AI 代理人做出違規行為</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A new test assumes AI agents can go rogue and asks whether they can resist temptation.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這項新測試假設 AI 代理人可能失控，並檢驗它們能否抵擋誘惑、不越出規範。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/ai-agents-can-get-honeypotted-too-aw/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Google adds pre-execution policy checks to AI agent security<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 擴充 AI 代理安全防護，新增執行前政策檢查機制</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google previewed Semantic Governance Policies, which use an LLM to check an agent's intended tool actions against user requests and enterprise policy, blocking violations before execution.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 推出語意治理政策預覽版，以 LLM 在代理執行工具操作前檢查是否符合使用者要求與企業政策，不符者先行阻擋，可防範提示詞注入。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180723\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Even the best AI agents struggle with everyday life<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">就連最強的 AI 代理人，也難以應付日常任務</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A new benchmark shows even the most advanced AI models struggle to complete everyday tasks reliably and safely without introducing new problems.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一項新基準測試顯示，即使是最先進的 AI 模型，也難以穩定、安全地完成日常任務，還可能製造新問題。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/24/even-the-best-ai-agents-struggle-with-everyday-life/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Tidal announces ban on AI-generated music; 27 million tracks will be deleted<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Tidal 宣布禁止 AI 生成音樂，2,700 萬首曲目將被刪除</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI songs account for 6.3 percent of Tidal's catalog, but it's about to be zero. The ban takes effect December 9.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI 歌曲占 Tidal 曲庫的 6.3%，但即將歸零；禁令自 12 月 9 日起生效。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/11/tidal-will-ban-fully-ai-generated-music-on-december-9/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}